INT. SYNERGY SOLUTIONS - CONFERENCE ROOM 12 - DAY

DARIUS FEATHERSTONEHAUGH
Thanks for squeezing me in, Penelope.

PENELOPE ACHTERBERG-SOLOMON
Always. You have fifteen minutes.

DARIUS FEATHERSTONEHAUGH
I only need ten. I want to talk about a rebrand.

PENELOPE ACHTERBERG-SOLOMON
Of what?

DARIUS FEATHERSTONEHAUGH
Of the team.

PENELOPE ACHTERBERG-SOLOMON
We're a team of two.

DARIUS FEATHERSTONEHAUGH
That's the problem. We feel like a duo. I want us to feel like a movement.

PENELOPE ACHTERBERG-SOLOMON
A movement of two.

DARIUS FEATHERSTONEHAUGH
A movement that has not yet scaled.

PENELOPE ACHTERBERG-SOLOMON
Go on.

DARIUS FEATHERSTONEHAUGH
I propose we call ourselves the Alignment Pod.

PENELOPE ACHTERBERG-SOLOMON
The Alignment Pod.

DARIUS FEATHERSTONEHAUGH
With a mission statement. Draft: "To align what is misaligned, and to pod what is unpodded."

PENELOPE ACHTERBERG-SOLOMON
What does "pod" mean as a verb?

DARIUS FEATHERSTONEHAUGH
It means to gather in the spirit of synergy.

PENELOPE ACHTERBERG-SOLOMON
Darius, how long have you worked here?

DARIUS FEATHERSTONEHAUGH
Eleven years in March.

PENELOPE ACHTERBERG-SOLOMON
And in eleven years, you have never once had a new idea.

DARIUS FEATHERSTONEHAUGH
That is unkind.

PENELOPE ACHTERBERG-SOLOMON
It's also the reason I'm going to approve this.

DARIUS FEATHERSTONEHAUGH
You are?

PENELOPE ACHTERBERG-SOLOMON
On one condition. You are the only member of the Alignment Pod.

DARIUS FEATHERSTONEHAUGH
And you?

PENELOPE ACHTERBERG-SOLOMON
I am the Pod's supervisor, from a distance.

DARIUS FEATHERSTONEHAUGH
I'll take it.

PENELOPE ACHTERBERG-SOLOMON
Good. Your ten minutes are up.

DARIUS FEATHERSTONEHAUGH
Penelope, one last thing.

PENELOPE ACHTERBERG-SOLOMON
Yes?

DARIUS FEATHERSTONEHAUGH
The Pod will require a budget.

PENELOPE ACHTERBERG-SOLOMON
Of course it will.
